@startuml
title HSS activation fallout - Order fallout analysis

participant "Fallout\nManagement" as FM #lightgrey
participant "Event\nManagement" as Event #grey
participant "Resource Order Management" as ROM #blue
participant "Resource Inventory" as RI #blue
participant "Service Inventory" as SI #blue
participant "Product Inventory" as PI
participant "Resource Usage\nMagement" as RUM #blue

note left of FM : continued from\nchapter 5.1.1.2

FM -> FM : 1 Update fallout\n(state='Processing/Analysing')

FM -> Event : 2 **TMF688 Event Management**\nPOST event falloutStateChange (falloutId, state="Processing/Analysing")
activate Event
Event --> FM : 3 **TMF688** 201 Created
deactivate Event

FM -> ROM : 4 **TMF652 Resource Order Management**\nGET /resourceOrder (id)
activate ROM
ROM --> FM : 5 **TMF652** 200 OK\n(resourceOrder, MSISDN)
deactivate ROM

FM -> RI : 6 **TMF639 Resource Inventory Management**\nGET /resource (msisdn)
activate RI
RI --> FM : 7 **TMF639** 204 No Content\n"No resources found"
deactivate RI

FM -> SI : 8 **TMF638 Service Inventory Management**\nGET /service (msisdn)
activate SI
SI --> FM : 9 **TMF638** 204 No Content\n"No services found"
deactivate SI

FM -> PI : 10 **TMF637 Product Inventory Management**\nGET /product (number)
activate PI
PI --> FM : 11 **TMF637** 204 No Content\n"No products found"
deactivate PI

FM -> RUM : 12 **TMF635 Usage Management**\nGET /usage (msisdn)
activate RUM
RUM --> FM : 13 **TMF635** 204 No Content\n"No usages found"
deactivate RUM

note left of FM : continued in\nchapter 5.1.1.4

@enduml
